      "decay_ic_5d": 0.0382823,
      "decay_ic_10d": 0.0401709,
      "decay_ic_20d": 0.0239490
    },
    "regime_notes": "Positive in 2025-2026 (IC 0.07498, 108 dates) and 2027-2028 (IC 0.04379, 521 dates), but weaker in the recent 2028-09-01 through 2029-06-18 regime (IC 0.01673, ICIR 0.05354). Interpret conservatively because the cross-section contains 15 assets; each valid date used at least 8 and averaged 11.55 instruments.",
